<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">E. Guha, R. Marten, S. Keh, N. Raoof, G. Smyrnis, H. Bansal, M. Nezhurina, J. Mercat, T. Vu, Z. Sprague, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span>
